(7666700, 1250793, 24511, '<td valign="top">This is my lowest solo photo at 5 leaving me with a want for light, color and focus.  Framing is good and fence theme also.  I must say being a owner of a few last place submissions good luck and may the peer pressure voting treats you with kindness.</td>', 'This is my lowest solo photo at 5 leaving me with a want for light, color and focus.  Framing is good and fence theme also.  I must say being a owner of a few last place submissions good luck and may the peer pressure voting treats you with kindness.', '2020-06-17 19:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666701, 1250799, 24511, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Pearly Gates added to my favorites.  Did not like the light curve of light at the bottom left corner streaking to the upper right corner.  Last minute noticed a fun silhouette of an antenna at the far distance in front of a white cloud.  A bit of a treasure hunt for me looking for hidden items</td>', 'Wow!  Pearly Gates added to my favorites.  Did not like the light curve of light at the bottom left corner streaking to the upper right corner.  Last minute noticed a fun silhouette of an antenna at the far distance in front of a white cloud.  A bit of a treasure hunt for me looking for hidden items', '2020-06-17 19:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666702, 1250766, 24511, '<td valign="top">This one made me think immediately that it was edited into a painting from software.  It made me think that overexposure can produce a beautiful work of art.</td>', 'This one made me think immediately that it was edited into a painting from software.  It made me think that overexposure can produce a beautiful work of art.', '2020-06-17 19:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666703, 1250786, 24511, '<td valign="top">My third 10 vote so far.  loved the different directions of both the fence and the clouds.</td>', 'My third 10 vote so far.  loved the different directions of both the fence and the clouds.', '2020-06-17 19:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666704, 1250797, 24511, '<td valign="top">I can only laugh noticing this reminds me of another 10 of mine in the previous path challenge that happened to be my favorite. No wonder I had allotted this one a 10 at first glance.  Not as good as the path photo but great design.  Would have liked more light and shadow variations or something to create a bit of tension</td>', 'I can only laugh noticing this reminds me of another 10 of mine in the previous path challenge that happened to be my favorite. No wonder I had allotted this one a 10 at first glance.  Not as good as the path photo but great design.  Would have liked more light and shadow variations or something to create a bit of tension', '2020-06-17 19:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666705, 1250798, 24511, '<td valign="top">Mmm... could be a top 10 or bottom 4.  Initial glance loved it but now after a closer look the white to dark variation could have been stronger for me less blah more bold.  Keeping my 10 score because first impressions are often correct.</td>', 'Mmm... could be a top 10 or bottom 4.  Initial glance loved it but now after a closer look the white to dark variation could have been stronger for me less blah more bold.  Keeping my 10 score because first impressions are often correct.', '2020-06-17 19:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
